{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_182_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"繼正即位，正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"二、叔孫豹會晉趙武、楚公子圍、齊國弱、宋向戌、衞齊惡、陳公子招、蔡公孫歸生、鄭罕虎、許人、曹人於郭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"三、三月，取鄆。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"四、夏，秦伯之弟鍼出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"諸侯之尊，弟兄不得以屬通。其弟云者，親之也。親而奔之，惡也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"五、六月，丁巳，邾子華卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"六、晉荀吳帥師敗狄於大原。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"傳曰，中國曰大原，夷狄曰大鹵，號從中國，名從主人。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"七、秋，莒去疾自齊入於莒，莒展出奔吳。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"八、叔弓帥師疆鄆田。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"疆之為言猶竟也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"九、葬邾悼公。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"十、冬，十有一月，己酉，楚子卷卒。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_182_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_182","textTraditional":"十二、楚公子比出奔晉。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}